{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "nflbet-0001-0001-0001-nflbet000001",
    "name": "NFL BET API",
    "description": "Workflow complet d'une semaine NFL BET (mode manuel v1).\n\n## Mise en route\n1. Onglet **Variables** : renseigne `baseUrl` (URL de ta fonction `api`), et pour l'auth soit :\n   - `firebaseApiKey` + `testEmail` + `testPassword` puis lance **0. Auth > Sign in** (capture l'idToken automatiquement), soit\n   - colle directement un `idToken` (obtenu depuis ton app).\n2. Assure-toi d'avoir déployé le back et lancé `seed:teams` + `import:players`.\n3. Exécute les dossiers **dans l'ordre** (1 → 6). Les IDs (leagueId, seasonId, matchId, bonusId) se capturent tout seuls.\n\nAuth : Bearer {{idToken}} au niveau collection.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{idToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://europe-west1-REMPLACER.cloudfunctions.net/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "firebaseApiKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "testEmail",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "testPassword",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "idToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "playerUid",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "leagueId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "seasonId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "week",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "matchId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "bonusId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Auth (obtenir un idToken)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign in (Firebase email/password)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signInWithPassword?key={{firebaseApiKey}}",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": [
                "identitytoolkit",
                "googleapis",
                "com"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "accounts:signInWithPassword"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "key",
                  "value": "{{firebaseApiKey}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Nécessite le provider Email/Password activé + un utilisateur de test créé. Capture idToken et playerUid.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{testEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{testPassword}}\",\n  \"returnSecureToken\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.idToken) { pm.collectionVariables.set('idToken', j.idToken); pm.collectionVariables.set('playerUid', j.localId); }",
                  "pm.test('idToken reçu', () => pm.expect(j.idToken, JSON.stringify(j)).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
